DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
43214::$$$message_0363_0000_0000$$$::"So, you finally nabbed yourself an onsen."::
43215::$$$message_0363_0000_0001$$$::"Hmph. To think it was a facility like this. Well, at least it passes for a bathhouse."::
43216::$$$message_0363_0000_0002$$$::"What are you talking about, man? All you did was beat up a woman and a child for a land deed!"::
43217::$$$message_0363_0000_0003$$$::"I'm sure they won't mind. We have strawberry milk now."::
43218::$$$message_0363_0000_0004$$$::"Shut up, ya fake priest. Stop raising your pinky. Is it even actually strawberry-flavored? You didn't add chili peppers to it, did you?"::
43219::$$$message_0363_0000_0005$$$::"Mwahahahaha! You're awfully confident to be looking away from me during a match, Lancer!"::
43220::$$$message_0363_0000_0006$$$::"Feh! As if I'd lose to you in a head-to-head match when Noble Phantasms aren't in the mix!"::
43221::$$$message_0363_0000_0007$$$::"Who said Noble Phantasms aren't allowed? Mwahahahaha! Taste the utter difference in our power! Gate of Babylon!"::
43222::$$$message_0363_0000_0008$$$::"What the hell!? I thought we were playing ping ponnnng!"::
43223::$$$message_0363_0000_0009$$$::"Show me what you're made of, Lancer. Even the mongrel managed to fend off this many."::
43224::$$$message_0363_0000_0010$$$::"Kuh, this is nothing... [hfangry layer=1]Wait, am I the one who has to clean up this mess!?"::
Ä